# Mainnet counterparts, read when the testnet/mainnet toggle in Settings is
# switched to mainnet. ROOTSTOCK_NODE_MAIN and TOKENS_MAIN must be filled in
# with a real mainnet RPC endpoint and real mainnet token contract addresses
# respectively before enabling mainnet mode — left blank here on purpose
# rather than guessed, since a wrong contract address could send funds to the
# wrong place. BITCOIN_ESPLORA_URL_MAIN/BLOCK_EXPLORER_URL_MAIN/
# BTC_BLOCK_EXPLORER_URL_MAIN default to public mainnet endpoints that are
# safe to ship as-is.
